@HostAddress = http://localhost:5246

### 1. Swagger UI & OpenAPI Specification
# Interactive Swagger UI in browser: http://localhost:5246/swagger
GET {{HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Doctors
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/doctors
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get Selectable Booking Dates
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/dates
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get Doctor's Daily Schedule (Slots for Doctor ID: 1)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/doctors/1/schedule?date=2026-11-18
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Book an Appointment
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/book
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-11-18T09:00:00",
  "patientFirstName": "John",
  "patientLastName": "Doe",
  "patientPhoneNumber": "+1-555-0199",
  "patientDateOfBirth": "1992-04-15"
}

###

### 6. Get Patient Appointments (Patient ID: 1)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/patients/1/appointments
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Cancel Appointment
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Appointments/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": 1,
  "patientId": 1
}

###
